{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3128220/extras/4867fd7c3eeef04fb2775fb46a594569.avif?t=1759432952\" width=1232 height=600 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forty years old, no savings, no plan, and a mom who waits for rent every single week. Welcome to Mervin\u2019s world \u2013 the adulthood simulator where every task spirals out of control faster than you can blink.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">About the Game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your goal is simple. Earn enough money to finally move out of your mom\u2019s house. How you do it? That\u2019s up to you\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3128220/extras/f47a2e71819f80ccd714987fb6668679.poster.avif?t=1759432952\" width=1170 height=950 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3128220/extras/f47a2e71819f80ccd714987fb6668679.webm?t=1759432952\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try your luck at the casino, go all in on crypto, or befriend some shady characters! Just remember\u2014you can lose everything just as fast, and when that happens\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3128220/extras/240afbdc3b40a3880e5b51d68191cced.poster.avif?t=1759432952\" width=1170 height=570 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3128220/extras/240afbdc3b40a3880e5b51d68191cced.webm?t=1759432952\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Honest work? A nightmare. But sometimes it\u2019s the only option. Mow lawns, scrub toilets, or work at the garbage sorting facility\u2014earn slowly, but honestly!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3128220/extras/cf55f1f86123ae9d3d15fa4f72199267.poster.avif?t=1759432952\" width=1170 height=570 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3128220/extras/cf55f1f86123ae9d3d15fa4f72199267.webm?t=1759432952\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Short on cash for rent? Pick up a side gig dancing at a strip club. Completely broke? Challenge your mom to a fistfight!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3128220/extras/36e333dcfaa073f7bbe1c604ecf9c8a7.poster.avif?t=1759432952\" width=1170 height=570 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3128220/extras/36e333dcfaa073f7bbe1c604ecf9c8a7.webm?t=1759432952\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Life isn\u2019t just about work. Hit the gym, paint some pictures, or befriend a goldfish so you don\u2019t lose your mind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3128220/extras/b7c775fc0d77332d4f5a91ad070867a0.poster.avif?t=1759432952\" width=1170 height=570 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3128220/extras/b7c775fc0d77332d4f5a91ad070867a0.webm?t=1759432952\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this world, nothing is normal. Dialogues drip with dark humor, characters balance on the edge of absurdity, and at every step you\u2019ll be asking yourself: \u201cWTF?!\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">What\u2019s Inside?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A wild storyline packed with absurd choices and unpredictable consequences</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A unique mix of 2D and 3D tasks, a fully interactive room, and Mervin\u2019s command center \u2013 his Doors XD computer</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dozens of absurd mini-games inspired by Mervin\u2019s most ridiculous jobs and side hustles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Managing Mervin\u2019s needs such as sleep, hunger, and bladder (beware, he can be moody!)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Room customization and a progression system shaping your chaotic lifestyle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Black humor dialogues and a cast of bizarre, over-the-top characters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everyday activities to (barely) keep Mervin sane: gym, painting, weird hobbies, and much more</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A crazy blend of simulation, comedy, and the painful struggle of adult life</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Add <i>Nerd Simulator</i> to your wishlist and get ready for the weirdest adulthood simulation ever\u2026</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3128220?t=1759432952","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3128220/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759432952","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3128220/fb9ad9c7cda0058aeca0d9d646fd6cde93bc4fc2/capsule_231x87_alt_assets_0.jpg?t=1759432952","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3128220/fb9ad9c7cda0058aeca0d9d646fd6cde93bc4fc2/capsule_184x69_alt_assets_0.jpg?t=1759432952","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3525010,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3128220/extras/4867fd7c3eeef04fb2775fb46a594569.avif?t=1759432952\" width=1232 height=600 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forty years old, no savings, no plan, and a mom who waits for rent every single week. Welcome to Mervin\u2019s world \u2013 the adulthood simulator where every task spirals out of control faster than you can blink.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">About the Game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your goal is simple. Earn enough money to finally move out of your mom\u2019s house. How you do it? That\u2019s up to you\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3128220/extras/f47a2e71819f80ccd714987fb6668679.poster.avif?t=1759432952\" width=1170 height=950 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3128220/extras/f47a2e71819f80ccd714987fb6668679.webm?t=1759432952\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try your luck at the casino, go all in on crypto, or befriend some shady characters! Just remember\u2014you can lose everything just as fast, and when that happens\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3128220/extras/240afbdc3b40a3880e5b51d68191cced.poster.avif?t=1759432952\" width=1170 height=570 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3128220/extras/240afbdc3b40a3880e5b51d68191cced.webm?t=1759432952\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Honest work? A nightmare. But sometimes it\u2019s the only option. Mow lawns, scrub toilets, or work at the garbage sorting facility\u2014earn slowly, but honestly!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3128220/extras/cf55f1f86123ae9d3d15fa4f72199267.poster.avif?t=1759432952\" width=1170 height=570 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3128220/extras/cf55f1f86123ae9d3d15fa4f72199267.webm?t=1759432952\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Short on cash for rent? Pick up a side gig dancing at a strip club. Completely broke? Challenge your mom to a fistfight!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3128220/extras/36e333dcfaa073f7bbe1c604ecf9c8a7.poster.avif?t=1759432952\" width=1170 height=570 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3128220/extras/36e333dcfaa073f7bbe1c604ecf9c8a7.webm?t=1759432952\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Life isn\u2019t just about work. Hit the gym, paint some pictures, or befriend a goldfish so you don\u2019t lose your mind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3128220/extras/b7c775fc0d77332d4f5a91ad070867a0.poster.avif?t=1759432952\" width=1170 height=570 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3128220/extras/b7c775fc0d77332d4f5a91ad070867a0.webm?t=1759432952\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this world, nothing is normal. Dialogues drip with dark humor, characters balance on the edge of absurdity, and at every step you\u2019ll be asking yourself: \u201cWTF?!\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">What\u2019s Inside?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A wild storyline packed with absurd choices and unpredictable consequences</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A unique mix of 2D and 3D tasks, a fully interactive room, and Mervin\u2019s command center \u2013 his Doors XD computer</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dozens of absurd mini-games inspired by Mervin\u2019s most ridiculous jobs and side hustles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Managing Mervin\u2019s needs such as sleep, hunger, and bladder (beware, he can be moody!)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Room customization and a progression system shaping your chaotic lifestyle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Black humor dialogues and a cast of bizarre, over-the-top characters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everyday activities to (barely) keep Mervin sane: gym, painting, weird hobbies, and much more</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A crazy blend of simulation, comedy, and the painful struggle of adult life</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Add <i>Nerd Simulator</i> to your wishlist and get ready for the weirdest adulthood simulation ever\u2026</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Radikate"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3128220/67be23ea32b59096e29639694466478c9c5818f0/header_alt_assets_0.jpg?t=1759432952","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3128220/127227744/bc30ec669410dc70b83ad7a9e494b4295709eee6/1757851939/dash_av1.mpd?t=1757853753","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3128220/127227744/bc30ec669410dc70b83ad7a9e494b4295709eee6/1757851939/dash_h264.mpd?t=1757853753","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3128220/127227744/bc30ec669410dc70b83ad7a9e494b4295709eee6/1757851939/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1757853753","id":257197544,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257197544/movie480.mp4?t=1757853753","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257197544/movie_